+        $this->notify($today->copy()->subDays(3), NotificationTiming::ThreeDaysAfter, [ReadingPlanStatus::InProgress, ReadingPlanStatus::Expired]);
+```
+- three_days_before / on_due_date は `[ReadingPlanStatus::InProgress]` のみ。
+- three_days_after は `[ReadingPlanStatus::InProgress, ReadingPlanStatus::Expired]`（completed以外）。
